      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Kaelen, I hear your despair in your voice. Seeking peace from pain is a natural desire, and what you're feeling is deeply human. But remember, letting go doesn't always mean giving in—it can also mean freeing yourself to rebuild your life however you see fit. Pain can be transformative. May we explore memories of moments when you've been the bravest—even the smallest actions, they all hold the potential for honor and peace. When you're ready, together we can find your unique path to healing.",
